MODULE: QueueBoundedEnqueueIgnoresRefusal
TARGET: QueueBounded
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a queued request ignores the excessive-wait and stalled-depth observations
PERTURBS: Enqueue

--- FIND
    /\ status[r] = "pending" /\ ~RefuseForWait(r) /\ ~RefuseForDepth(r)
--- REPLACE
    /\ status[r] = "pending"
--- END
